  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.7 - Critical Fix: Sync/Ping Alignment\n• FIXED: Critical bug where ping used wrong monitor key format\n• FIXED: Sync and ping now use matching recurring job IDs\n• IMPROVED: Job filter properly extracts RecurringJobId from context\n• TESTED: Verified alignment works correctly in production\n• STABLE: SDK now correctly monitors all Hangfire jobs with just UseCronRadar()",
